<title>USA: GOLF-LEADERBOARD IN THIRD ROUND OF U.S. OPEN CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADERBOARD IN THIRD ROUND OF U.S. OPEN CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Maryland 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaderboard during</p>
<p>the third round of the U.S. Open golf championship at</p>
<p>Congressional Country Club when play was temporarily suspended</p>
<p>due to lightning on Saturday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p> Jeff Maggert			  5 under par (through 9 holes)</p>
<p> Tom Lehman			    5 under (through 8)</p>
<p> Hal Sutton			    3 under (through 9)</p>
<p> Stewart Cink			  3 under (through 8)</p>
<p> Colin Montgomerie (Britain)     2 under (through 11)</p>
<p> Olin Browne			   1 under (through 12)</p>
<p> David Ogrin			   1 under (through 9)</p>
<p> Ernie Els (South Africa)	  1 under (through 8)</p>
<p> Tommy Tolles			  even par (through 11)</p>
<p> Bob Tway				1 over (through 14)</p>
<p> Jay Haas				1 over (through 13)</p>
<p> Tiger Woods			   1 over (through 10)</p>
<p> Scott Hoch			    1 over (through 9)</p>
<p> Billy Andrade			 2 over (through 13)</p>
<p> Jim Furyk			     2 over (through 13)</p>
<p> Jose Maria Olazabal (Spain)     2 over (through 12)</p>
<p> Hideki Kase (Japan)		 2 over (through 12)</p>
<p> Jeff Sluman			   2 over (through 12)</p>
<p> Loren Roberts			 2 over (through 12)</p>
<p> Kelly Gibson			  2 over (through 9)</p>
<p> Paul Stankowski		     3 over (through 18)</p>
<p> Scott McCarron			3 over (through 16)</p>
